## 2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & PLATFORM SPECIFICATIONS

| Component | Target Specification |
|---|---|
| **Host System** | Windows 11 with WSL2 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble Numbat) |
| **Target Hardware** | Lenovo ThinkPad T480, Intel Core i5-8250U, 8GB RAM, UHD 620 |
| **Virtualization** | Microsoft Hyper-V Gen 2 UEFI, VirtualBox VMSVGA + 3D, QEMU/KVM, VMware |
| **Base Distribution** | Minimal Ubuntu 24.04 LTS via debootstrap (`minbase` variant) |
| **Live Boot Stack** | Ubuntu native Casper stack (`boot=casper`). Debian live-boot is forbidden. |
| **Display Server** | Wayland via Hyprland compositor. Software fallback via `llvmpipe` inside VMs. |
| **Windows Compat** | Flatpak-isolated Bottles runner with Wine Staging, DXVK, VKD3D-Proton, `xeno-windows`. |
| **Shell & GUI** | TypeScript Astal v2 (Bun runtime) for shell; PySide6 for scientific desktop panels. |
| **Kernel Source** | XanMod Linux 6.12+ (BORE EEVDF scheduler + Kali `mac80211` frame injection patches). |

